# Statement of Work — Platform Migration

A consulting proposal where the rates table is the single source of truth.
Change a rate or a headcount in the table and every total below follows.

<!-- table: team (role, rate, hc, weeks) -->
| Role              | Hourly rate | Headcount | Weeks |
|-------------------|-------------|-----------|-------|
| Engagement lead   | $300        | 1         | 12    |
| Senior engineer   | $250        | 2         | 12    |
| Engineer          | $175        | 3         | 10    |
| Analyst           | $125        | 2         | 8     |

## Effort and cost

hours_per_week = 40
hours = team.hc * team.weeks * hours_per_week
line_cost = team.rate * hours
subtotal = sum(line_cost)
contingency = 10% of subtotal
total = subtotal + contingency

## Team summary

people = sum(team.hc)
roles = count(team.role)
top_rate = max(team.rate)
blended_rate = subtotal / sum(hours)

## Line items

| Role              | Hours       | Cost            |
|-------------------|-------------|-----------------|
| Engagement lead   | {{hours}}   | {{line_cost}}   |
| Senior engineer   | {{hours}}   | {{line_cost}}   |
